    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="9" relname="span">Interesting point you made there P39.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="11" relname="span">I once took a web designtechnology course  that emphaized the same concepts during the course.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="14" relname="sequence">Find an existing template that works and is pleasing to you</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="14" relname="sequence">and reuseit.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="15" relname="span">Our assignment also provided a great introduction to reverseengineering of an existing template to create a new interface.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="12" relname="span">I agreethat the wheel does not need to be reinvented,</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="13" relname="conjunction">as long as it providesgood usability characteristics</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="13" relname="conjunction">and copyrights laws are not violated.</segment>
        <group id="9" type="span"/>
        <group id="10" type="span" parent="1" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="11" type="span" parent="10" relname="span"/>
        <group id="12" type="span" parent="5" relname="elaboration"/>
